                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Percentage of planned initiatives delivered within the expected timeframe.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Number and impact of release delays caused by dependencies or blockers.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Customer adoption and usage of newly released capabilities.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Customer feedback and satisfaction following major releases.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Business outcomes generated by released features and improvements.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Stakeholder confidence and visibility into upcoming product delivery.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>
